# oc-sim scenario v1
# The Melody applet (journal/D-047): open the app menu, move the highlight down
# six times to MELODY (the SEQUENCE column), launch it, make the loop 16 steps
# long, then send six clocks on TR1, 100 ticks apart. The snapshot shows the
# sixth step playing: its mark filled under the playhead, 06/16 in the title
# with the note A carries, the first page of settings.
ticks 900
20  button up down
60  button down down
70  button up up
70  button down up
90  button down down
100 button down up
110 button down down
120 button down up
130 button down down
140 button down up
150 button down down
160 button down up
170 button down down
180 button down up
190 button down down
200 button down up
220 button right down
226 button right up
250 encoder 2 +8
300 trigger 1 high
305 trigger 1 low
400 trigger 1 high
405 trigger 1 low
500 trigger 1 high
505 trigger 1 low
600 trigger 1 high
605 trigger 1 low
700 trigger 1 high
705 trigger 1 low
800 trigger 1 high
805 trigger 1 low
